{"title":"Polar Fleece Blankets","description":"\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"\/collections\/photo-blankets\"\u003eAll Photo Blankets\u003c\/a\u003e | \u003ca href=\"\/collections\/polar-fleece-photo-blankets\"\u003ePolar Fleece\u003c\/a\u003e | \u003ca href=\"\/collections\/plush-fleece-photo-blankets\"\u003ePlush Fleece\u003c\/a\u003e | \u003ca href=\"\/collections\/hd-woven-photo-blankets\"\u003eHD Woven\u003c\/a\u003e | \u003ca href=\"\/collections\/jacquard-woven-photo-blankets\"\u003eJacquard Woven\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"\/collections\/sherpa-throw-blankets\"\u003eSherpa\u003c\/a\u003e | \u003ca href=\"\/products\/water-repellent-outdoor-picnic-blanket-50x-59\"\u003ePicnic Blankets\u003c\/a\u003e | \u003ca href=\"\/collections\/themed-designer-blankets\"\u003eThemed Designers\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003ctable style=\"width: 94.8553%;\"\u003e\r\n\u003ctbody\u003e\r\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 77px;\"\u003e\r\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 25.9461%; height: 77px;\"\u003e\r\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Polar Fleece Photo Blanket\" src=\"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/files\/137507bf5c360582a47b2557243a6716_medium.jpg?v=1498323360\" style=\"float: none; display: block; margin: 0px auto 0px auto;\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003c\/td\u003e\r\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 59.0539%; height: 77px; text-align: center;\"\u003e\r\n\u003cblockquote\u003e\r\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/files\/PT_CatBlanketIMG__RGF_1024x1024.png?v=1498322957\" style=\"float: none; margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003c\/blockquote\u003e\r\n\u003c\/td\u003e\r\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\r\n\u003c\/tbody\u003e\r\n\u003c\/table\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Anti Pill Polar fleece (100% Polyester) - Thin, Soft, Smooth (Low Pile)\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Process:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Dye Sublimation, Full Color Full Bleed Image\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Ships in 3 to 5 Business Days\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePhoto Realistic\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003eExtremely Detailed\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"photo-collage-polar-fleece-blanket-30x40","title":"Quick Collage Polar Fleece Blanket-6 Image Template- 30\"x40\"","description":"\u003cp\u003eOur basic option - soft, smooth and lightweight. 1\/16 inch thick, dye sublimation imprinted. Makes a great throw or picnic blanket. This option allows you to quickly and easily design a 6 image collage with our ready to use template and your images!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul style=\"align: left;\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSize:\u003c\/strong\u003e 30\" x 40\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e Anti Pill 260 GSM Polar fleece (100% Polyester) - Thin, Low Pile\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Process:\u003c\/strong\u003e Dye Sublimation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ships in 3-5 Business Days.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSoftness Index:\u003c\/strong\u003e Brushed on both sides for soft feel.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"font-size: 12px;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eNOTE: The \"Collage Border\" area of any quick collage layout must be filled with a background color or pattern fill of some kind and cannot be left empty. Please do not place text or photos in the \"Collage Border\" area.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 class=\"description\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWatch a Video to see how Design tool Works\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/files\/PT_ProductBadge.png?v=1509137419\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"vendor-unknown","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41979081667,"sku":"30x40RGF-CLG","price":39.95,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/products\/photo-blankets-quick-photo-collage-polar-fleece-blanket-30-x40-1.jpg?v=1506966118"},{"product_id":"photo-collage-polar-fleece-blanket-60-x-80","title":"Quick Collage Polar Fleece Blanket-12 Image Template- 60\" x 80\"","description":"\u003cp\u003eOur basic option - soft, smooth and lightweight at only 1\/8 inch thick, with dye sublimated imprint. Makes a great throw or picnic blanket. This option allows you to quickly and easily design a 12 image collage with our ready to use template and your images!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul style=\"align: left;\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSize:\u003c\/strong\u003e 60\" x 80\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e Anti Pill 365 GSM Polar fleece (100% Polyester) - Thin, Low Pile\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Process:\u003c\/strong\u003e Dye Sublimation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ships in 3-5 Business Days.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSoftness Index:\u003c\/strong\u003e Brushed on both sides for soft feel.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"font-size: 12px;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eNOTE: The \"Collage Border\" area of any quick collage layout must be filled with a background color or pattern fill of some kind and cannot be left empty. Please do not place text or photos in the \"Collage Border\" area.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 class=\"description\"\u0