F or TIF.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eResolution:\u003c\/strong\u003e 300 DPI or higher.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003csub\u003e\u003cem\u003eWe do not accept camera phone photos of the templates at this time. Please do not send them.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/sub\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cul style=\"align: left;\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSize:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e30\" x 40\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eAnti Pill 260 GSM Polar fleece (100% Polyester) - Thin, Low Pile\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Process:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eDye Sublimation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eShips in 3-5 Business Days.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSoftness Index:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eBrushed on both sides for soft feel.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/files\/PT_ProductBadge.png?v=1509137419\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"vendor-unknown","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":38158410627,"sku":"30x40RGF-KidsArt","price":39.95,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/products\/kids-creations-turn-your-child-s-drawing-into-a-30-x-40-polar-fleece-mini-blanket-1.jpg?v=1506966767"},{"product_id":"turn-your-childs-drawing-into-a-50-x-60-polar-fleece-blanket","title":"Turn Your Child's Drawing into a 50\" x 60\" Polar Fleece Blanket","description":"\u003cp\u003ePersonalThrows introduces a new way to celebrate your child's imagination and c